  m_text: '1. Use <b>W, A, S, and D</b> to move around.


    2. Click the <b>drum
    stage</b> to teleport to the drum seat.


    3. Press <b>T</b> to control the
    left drumstick.


    4. Press <b>Y</b> to control the right drumstick.


    5.
    Move your cursor to move the selected drumstick and hit the drums.


    6. Use
    the control panel to record, stop, replay, and save your performance.'
